      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0BT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1740350470,
      "version": 190,
      "versionNonce": 2106749562,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773196148458,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## Problem.\nYou are given a string s consisting of the following characters: '(', ')', '{', '}', '[' and ']'.\n\nThe input string s is valid if and only if:\n\n- Every open bracket is closed by the same type of close bracket.\n- Open brackets are closed in the correct order.\n- Every close bracket has a corresponding open bracket of the same type.\n\nReturn true if s is a valid string, and false otherwise.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## Problem.\nYou are given a string s consisting of the following characters: '(', ')', '{', '}', '[' and ']'.\n\nThe input string s is valid if and only if:\n\n- Every open bracket is closed by the same type of close bracket.\n- Open brackets are closed in the correct order.\n- Every close bracket has a corresponding open bracket of the same type.\n\nReturn true if s is a valid string, and false otherwise.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Fp37YpA7Df5Y05AUv0-ec",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1564.5674954804301,
      "y": 21529.171980076808,
      "width": 1669.3551025390625,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0BU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2046112582,
      "version": 812,
      "versionNonce": 2089036198,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773196201722,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## Questions\n- First of all how can we call these characters? '(', ')', '{', '}', '[' and ']'. -> parenthesis, curly brace, bracket\n\n(        open parenthesis        \n)        close parenthesis        \n{        open curly brace        \n}        close curly brace        \n[        open square bracket        \n]        close square bracket \n\n- Does string s contain other characters? -> Nothing, '(', ')', '{', '}', '[' and ']' only.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## Questions\n- First of all how can we call these characters? '(', ')', '{', '}', '[' and ']'. -> parenthesis, curly brace, bracket\n\n(        open parenthesis        \n)        close parenthesis        \n{        open curly brace        \n}        close curly brace        \n[        open square bracket        \n]        close square bracket \n\n- Does string s contain other characters? -> Nothing, '(', ')', '{', '}', '[' and ']' only.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cI_0JG3ObyDWDuXLJNaBi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1569.956203016047,
      "y": 22125.18040609855,
      "width": 848.483642578125,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0BV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 79354502,
      "version": 1234,
      "versionNonce": 806778918,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773196238099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## Happy path\n- s = \"[]\" true\n- s = \"([{}])\" true\n\n- s = \"[[\" false\n- s = \"([}])\" false\n\n- s = \"[][]\" true\n\n## edge case\n- s = \"\" ? -> The length of s is more than 1 character.\n\n## constraints\n1 <= s.length <= 1000\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## Happy path\n- s = \"[]\" true\n- s = \"([{}])\" true\n\n- s = \"[[\" false\n- s = \"([}])\" false\n\n- s = \"[][]\" true\n\n## edge case\n- s = \"\" ? -> The length of s is more than 1 character.\n\n## constraints\n1 <= s.length <= 1000\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
